Scope. The MIT terms above cover the code in src/, experiments/ and tests/,
and the JSON artifacts in results/.

The manuscript in paper/ is not covered by them. On acceptance JMLR publishes
under CC-BY 4.0 and copyright stays with the author; until then the manuscript
sources are provided for review and reproduction only.

Third-party material. data/ contains items drawn from public benchmarks
(GSM8K, CommonsenseQA, MATH, AIME/AMC, LeetCodeDataset), each under its own
licence and cited in the paper. paper/refs_pdf/ is not tracked in this
repository: those are publisher and arXiv PDFs of cited work, and
paper/fetch_references.py downloads them on demand instead.
